OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway delays as M3 southbound
OL,4,Aclosed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers on the M3 southbound are being
OL,7,Fwarned to expect delays due to a
OL,8,Fpolice-led incident.
OL,10,FA stretch of the motorway is closed
OL,11,Ffrom Junction 12 near Eastleigh.
OL,13,FTraffic is being diverted off the
OL,14,Fmotorway slip road with long delays
OL,15,Fbuilding on the approach to the
OL,16,Fjunction.
OL,18,FNational Highways said police
OL,19,Finvestigation works were ongoing with
OL,20,Fdrivers urged to allow extra time for
OL,21,Ftheir journey or seek alternative
OL,22,Froutes.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
